<title>GERMANY: Pan-German August adjusted unemployment rises.</title>
<headline>Pan-German August adjusted unemployment rises.</headline>
<text>
<p>NUREMBERG, Germany, Sept 5 Reuter) - The Federal Labour Office reported the following economic indicator:</p>
<p> PAN-GERMAN UNEMPLOYMENT   Aug 96	Jul 96	   Aug 95</p>
<p> Number (unadj)		3.902 mln   3.912 mln	3.578 mln</p>
<p> Number (adj)		  3.939 mln   3.925 mln	3.613 mln</p>
<p> Change in adj number     +14,000     -2,000	    n/a</p>
<p> Rate (unadj)		  10.2 pct    10.2 pct	 9.3 pct</p>
<p> Short-time workers	  163,975     225,123	  118,191</p>
<p> Vacancies (unadj)	   331,674     348,934	  330,766</p>
<p> Change in numbers in work Jun 96	May 96</p>
<p>				   -1,000	-4,000</p>
<p>NOTE - Previously announced data in brackets. Numbers in work data refer to change from previous month. Details on numbers in work to be released later today. --Bonn Newsroom 49-228-2609750</p>
</text>
